{"id":71673,"name":"Mária-út, M02-27A (Esztergom – Dobogókő)","category":"hike","country":"HU","generated_at":"2026-08-14T08:54:05+00:00","description_md":"The Mária-út M02-27A is a waymarked hiking route in HU that connects Esztergom and Dobogókő. This hard trail covers 19.5 km with 1078 m of ascent and 539 m of descent.\n\nThe route is part of an international waymarked hiking network and is signposted as M02-27. It takes about 7.2 hours to complete based on the DIN 33466 hiking time rule. The path passes within 300 m of the Chapel of Saint Thomas Becket and the Museum of the Danube. It also passes within 900 m of St Peter's and St Paul's Church.","distance_m":19535,"ascent_m":1078,"descent_m":539,"duration_min":433,"difficulty":"hard","sac_scale":null,"network":"iwn","bbox":[18.736957,47.718928,18.898756,47.800008],"geometry":{"type":"MultiLineString","coordinates":[[[18.736957,47.799666,154.5],[18.737412,47.799106,152.5],[18.737471,47.799033,152.3],[18.7376,47.799017,152.1],[18.737912,47.799114,148],[18.738014,47.799265,147],[18.73804,47.799386,146.8],[18.738405,47.799499,145.2],[18.738485,47.799519,144.8],[18.739281,47.799727,142.8],[18.739419,47.799763,141.6],[18.74023,47.799976,136.8],[18.740356,47.800008,136.3],[18.74043,47.799929,136.4],[18.740533,47.799838,136.5],[18.740641,47.799756,136],[18.740736,47.799687,135.3],[18.740999,47.799498,136],[18.741384,47.799264,134.5],[18.741409,47.79925,134.3],[18.741427,47.799239,134.3],[18.741471,47.799214,134.4],[18.741521,47.799189,134.6],[18.742007,47.798941,135.8],[18.742271,47.798804,136.4],[18.74246,47.79871,136.7],[18.742732,47.798574,137],[18.742805,47.798538,137.1],[18.742917,47.798484,137.3],[18.74315,47.798374,139.3],[18.743565,47.798167,142.4],[18.74402,47.797937,143.7],[18.74436,47.797798,144.4],[18.744611,47.797741,145.6],[18.744818,47.797727,146.1],[18.745061,47.797731,146.3],[18.74597,47.79782,149.2],[18.746198,47.797886,150],[18.746438,47.797906,149.8],[18.746547,47.797913,149.6]],[[18.746613,47.797981